    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būtoolwa na wingīji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A batongeeji ba kaya ja mu numba ya ng'wa Gileadi, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Makili, ng'witūnja o ng'wa Manase, abo shibyalīlwe shabo shalī shifumile mu ng'anda ja ng'wa Yosefu, bakiza kūlūngalūnga nū Musa, hamò na a batongeeji a bangī, a bataale ba ng'anda ja Baisilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būhaya, “Baba nkūjiwa ntaale wise, ū SEEBA aho alīkūlagīla gīkī ūtūmamīle mbale ū mu kūbagabanhya ī sī a Baisilaeli ībize wingīji wabo, akakūlagīla gīkī ū wingīji wa ndūgū wise ū Zelofehadi ūbinhe bashīke bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Al'ī gīsī lūūlū, ūlū būtoolwa na bagosha ba kūfuma mu ng'anda jingī najo ū mu Baisilaeli, ū wingīji wabo būtīnjiwa ū kūfuma ū mu wingīji wa bakūlūgenji bise, būsaamījiwe kū ng'anda ūko balatoolwe? Ūlū yūja gīko, angū ū wingīji ūbo tūhelelilwe bise būkūbiza wīnjiwa būtwalwa kūngī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'waka gwa Baisilaeli gwa kūshosha shikolo ūlū gūūshika, ū wingīji wabo angū būkūbiza bosangījiwa kū wingīji bo lūganda ūko balatoolwe! A henaho ī sabo ya wingīji wabo īkūbiza yasaamiwa kwīnga ū kū wingīji ūbo bahelelilwe bakūlūgenji bise!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Musa ūlagīlwa na SEEBA kūbinha a Baisilaeli shilagīlo shiishi. Ūhaya, “Īyo balīyīhaya a banhū ba shibyalīlwe sha lūganda lwa ng'wa Yosefu ītūngīlīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū mu mihayo ya bashīke ba ng'wa Zelofehadi, ū SEEBA walagīlile gīkī, batoolwe na munhū ose ose ūyo balantogwe, gwike abize wa mu numba ya lūganda lwa bakūlūgenji babo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu Baisilaeli būtīīho wingīji ūbo būkūsaamiwa kūfuma lūganda ūlū, kūja kū lūganda lūngī; nguno būlī Ng'wisilaeli akwīlang'hana ī sī īyo wanukūla kūbiza wingīji wakwe kūfuma kū bakūlūgenji bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū būlī ng'wana nkīma ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli ūyo wanukūla sī kūbiza wingīji wakwe, shing'wigeleelilwe atoolwe na munhū wa kūfuma mu numba ya lūganda lo ise; ībize gīkī būlī Ng'wisilaeli abūdimīīle ū wingījibo ng'wa ise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wingīji būtī wa kūsaamiwa kūfuma lūganda ūlū, kūja kū lūganda lūngī; nguno būlī lūganda lwa Baisilaeli shibigelile kwīlang'hana ī sī īyo īlī ya wingīji wabo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana a bashīke ba ng'wa Zelofehadi bīīta ūmo SEEBA akanagīīlīla ū Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bashīke benabo, a ba Mahala, Tīzīla, Hogla, Milika na Noa, būtoolwa na bagosha ba mu lūganda lwa ng'wa saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakatoolwa na bagosha ba kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha mu lūganda lo Manase, ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yosefu. Na lūūlū ū wingīji wabo wikala ū mu numba ya lūganda lwa ng'wa saabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī shenīshi h'ī shilagīlo na a kahelele ako SEEBA akabinha a Baisilaeli kūbītīla mulī Musa, aho bataalī mu mbūga ya Moabu, a ha ng'hambī ya hihī na mongo gwa Yolodani, īyo yalī yilolile na nzengo gwa Yeliko ū kū ntambūko gwa mongo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
